		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31591#p31591"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>les paramètres sont :</p><p>max_connections = 1000&#160; &#160; <br />shared_buffers =4GB<br />#wal_buffers = 16MB (n&#039;est pas utilisé)<br />work_mem =82MB&#160; &#160; <br />maintenance_work_mem =512MB</p>]]></content>
